{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tap with Ease, Keep the Beat!</i><br><i>Wacky Themes, Endless Fun!</i><br><i>BackSlap</i> is a 1K quirky rhythm idle game featuring hilarious themes like spa massages, panda karaoke, and otter clam-smashing, delivering a lighthearted and joyful gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bFun Themes, Massive Music Library\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Themes\u200b</strong>\u200b: Unlock absurd scenarios\u2014spa massages, panda karaoke, otter clam-smashing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bHuge Song Collection\u200b</strong>\u200b: Each theme comes with unique tracks and skins\u201490 songs to keep you hooked!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSimple Taps, One-Key Hide\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSingle-Key Play\u200b</strong>\u200b: Easy 1-track gameplay\u2014use your keyboard or mouse to tap along!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bAdjustable Difficulty\u200b</strong>\u200b: Choose <i>Gentle Tap</i> (casual) or <i>Hard Smack</i> (hardcore) modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bBoss Key\u200b</strong>\u200b: Customize a one-key hide feature for seamless &quot;work mode&quot; camouflage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bIdle &amp; Level Up\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bProgress Unlocks\u200b</strong>\u200b: Gain EXP by tapping\u2014unlock new themes effortlessly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bAFK Listening\u200b</strong>\u200b: Earn EXP while idle with background music\u2014level up while you chill!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bChallenge &amp; Compete\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bLeaderboards\u200b</strong>\u200b: Check your ranking after completing songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDaily Challenges\u200b</strong>\u200b: Random daily trials\u2014aim for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into <i>BackSlap</i> and start your whimsical rhythm adventure today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666470?t=1748252693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666470/346cc815e7d2d3154927f5aa7b6c495ef8c62e34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748252693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666470/d3edab36b85206f2fb228be9c9e1e1de1da91030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748252693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666470/d3edab36b85206f2fb228be9c9e1e1de1da91030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748252693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3757640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tap with Ease, Keep the Beat!</i><br><i>Wacky Themes, Endless Fun!</i><br><i>BackSlap</i> is a 1K quirky rhythm idle game featuring hilarious themes like spa massages, panda karaoke, and otter clam-smashing, delivering a lighthearted and joyful gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bFun Themes, Massive Music Library\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Themes\u200b</strong>\u200b: Unlock absurd scenarios\u2014spa massages, panda karaoke, otter clam-smashing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">